Package: goblin-speaks
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: arm64
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: gobbolab
Depends: tmux
Description: Goblin Speaks Fortune Teller Framework
 A Python-based fortune teller machine application for Raspberry Pi.
 Orchestrates animatronics, card dispensing, audio playback, and coin
 activation for an interactive fortune teller experience.
